      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "Unit 1 introduces this sentence pattern:\nयह (X) है ।    This is (X).\nयह चीन है ।    This is China.\nयह रूस है ।    This is Russia.\nयह बर्मा है ।    This is Burma.\nयह भारत है ।    This is India.\n\nThe question also fits this pattern:\nयह क्या है ?    This is what?\nयह this can be omitted.\nबर्मा है ।    It's Burma."
    }
